제품 무게\n1930g\n작동 온도\n0~40°C / 32°F~104°F\n보호 회로\nOVP/OCP/SCP\nFSP\nFSP에 대해\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t보도 자료\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t단종제품\n미디어\n제품리뷰\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t정기 후원\n서비스\n자원 센터\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t이용약관\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t개인정보보호정책\nCopyright © 2026 FSP GROUP. All rights reserved.",
